# Site header ↔ footer column alignment

Canonical write-up: `brand/DESIGN.md` § «Шапка ↔ футер (колонка)». Source: `owyxsite/frontend/components/layout/Header.tsx`.

## Rule

The sticky site chrome (`Header.tsx`) has **two layers**:

1. **Content column** — `max-w-6xl` + `px-4 sm:px-6`, same as `Footer.tsx`.
   - **Download** and **profile / ЛК** (or login/register CTA) sit on this column’s **right edge**.
2. **Viewport chrome** — `LanguageToggle` + `ThemeToggle` (+ mobile menu) are `absolute` on the **viewport right**, *outside* the content column.

## Do not

- Add always-on right padding on the content column (`sm:pr-28`, `sm:pr-48`, etc.) to “make room” for lang/theme. That pulls Download + ЛК **left of the footer edge** and looks like missing buttons (regression 2026-09-18).
- Move Download / ЛК into the absolute viewport-right cluster with lang/theme.

## Allowed collision guard

Only below `xl`, when the column is nearly full-bleed: `max-xl:pr-40` (or similar) so Download/ЛК do not overlap lang/theme. On `xl+`, right padding must match the footer (`sm:px-6`).
